剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"itjm10q5uoT1757424891450\",\"child_ids\":{\"itjm10q5uoT1757424891450\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"nbrp51fwk2T1757424891476\",\"child_ids\":{\"nbrp51fwk2T1757424891476\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"89vuzekxk9T1757424891484\",\"child_ids\":{\"89vuzekxk9T1757424891484\":[]},\"contents\":{}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"幸得一株芬芳。——2021-08-26\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e今日是我的生辰，但如你所知，宴请宾客一事总是费心劳神。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我便想着，这回不妨从简，联系一二至交足矣。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我做了些「乾坤摩拉肉」，你且尝尝。若有什么感想，但说无妨。我知道你对烹饪很有心得，机会难得，刚好听听你的评价。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e另外，前些日子听人说起，近日城外有野生琉璃百合盛开，我亲自去了一趟，有幸采得一株。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e与传言一样，确实是品质上乘，香气馥郁的野生花，比「玉京台」人工栽种的品种更珍奇。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e转给识货的人或许能卖个好价钱，不过，摩拉虽好，妙人倒也难得。我将亲手摘的花赠予你，望你能一同欣赏它的绽放。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"756\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/70e9deaddfc2f39a71b8f4257001bc78_4247746153843528709.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"琉璃百合\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/756/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/756/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e琉璃百合\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"184\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/09/25/24077343/29b367eba87054fb6121b28ce031f301_4745604186069189650.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"乾坤摩拉肉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"8\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e乾坤摩拉肉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*8\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/4c6932d22e207737cb6e1956795adaf5_6244145269827910854.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/4c6932d22e207737cb6e1956795adaf5_6244145269827910854.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/8888315\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e凝光生日快乐|哦？这片石叶是你雕成的？\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"],\"key\":\"\"}]},{\"tab_name\":\"小聚。——2022-08-26\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e近日听说一些奇闻，似乎有什么人正在大陆上进行堪称奇勇的旅行。我很感兴趣，想请有旅行心得的你前来一叙。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e无须担心，虽是到群玉阁会面，但你我本是朋友，无需任何礼物，无需讲究衣着。寻常小聚而已，三两小菜、浓茶薄酒都已备齐。如有其他需要的，向秘书们提出便是。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e今夜会有好气象，夜晚的璃月灯火更是耐看。你且来吧，我们慢叙。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e大陆上的冒险奇闻，你旅途中的故事…静候你道来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"663\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/dc64f0cbd6fc81cfb841711a6d588193_5293717487696147910.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"仙跳墙\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/663/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/663/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e仙跳墙\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2159\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/11/04/24077343/09638db5e7237160d16df520f42c46b5_5326446082576044836.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"鸡豆花\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2159/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2159/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e鸡豆花\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"184\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/09/25/24077343/29b367eba87054fb6121b28ce031f301_4745604186069189650.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"乾坤摩拉肉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e乾坤摩拉肉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/553d70d602e5d0f7e02cdf857fe68fac_2350417970333301597.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/553d70d602e5d0f7e02cdf857fe68fac_2350417970333301597.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/27994633\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e凝光生日快乐｜而更加让人高兴的是，赠予我这份礼物的人是你。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"],\"key\":\"\"}]},{\"tab_name\":\"棋友难觅。——2023-08-26\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e近日「七圣召唤」颇为风行，我的棋友们也有不少沉迷其中，想约一局「璃月千年」已比从前难上许多。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e却也难怪，棋戏规则繁琐，光是布设就要好一番功夫，行棋筹算又得劳费不少心神。有不少人劝我删繁就简，以便纳新。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过在我看来，为合适的商品寻到合适的顾客，也是商人的本业。棋戏若一味追求简化，反而会泯然于众。听说你在此道造诣不浅，如何权衡其中利弊，想必会有不少心得。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e若有空闲，可愿来群玉阁小聚？不必担心，棋盘棋子俱已布设妥当，权当作棋友相会就好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"756\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/70e9deaddfc2f39a71b8f4257001bc78_4247746153843528709.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"琉璃百合\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/756/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/756/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e琉璃百合\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"184\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/09/25/24077343/29b367eba87054fb6121b28ce031f301_4745604186069189650.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"乾坤摩拉肉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e乾坤摩拉肉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/3e099f8134bf2559ea20d1ee40e8e155_7239389349705822841.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/3e099f8134bf2559ea20d1ee40e8e155_7239389349705822841.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/42811196\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e凝光生日快乐｜立于高处，更能将漫天繁星尽收眼底…\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"],\"key\":\"\"}]},{\"tab_name\":\"烦请拨冗⋯——2024-08-26\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e前些时日在拍卖场上拍回几枚翠玉。与一同参拍的名物珍玩相比，未经雕饰的玉石未免显得平淡无奇。然而投资看重的，不是当下，而是未来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e保有天然的明净，又有成为任何模样的可能，我想，这样承载着淳美期许的玉石，什袭珍藏于群玉阁，并不是它最好的归宿。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e常说「佳物与能人配称，方可相得益彰」，因此期盼你能收下。玉石随你游历，经历年岁的洗礼后，不知会散发何种色泽？届时，就烦劳你再度拨冗，在未竟的棋局上与我分享一二了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e我会像今日一样，备办肴馔，诚意候光。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500710\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/31/195563531/885fe637e196b719e87dd9d7f8b90c1a_7299213044983213039.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"清水玉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"5\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500710/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500710/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e清水玉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*5\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"184\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/09/25/24077343/29b367eba87054fb6121b28ce031f301_4745604186069189650.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"乾坤摩拉肉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e乾坤摩拉肉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e  】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/9a9e0be531668a31718e859a6c3c2035_4509559604877440903.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/9a9e0be531668a31718e859a6c3c2035_4509559604877440903.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/56991634\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e凝光生日快乐｜哦？这把鎏金折扇同我很是相配？\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"],\"key\":\"\"}]},{\"tab_name\":\"闲叙建议⋯——2025-08-26\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e听闻你即将远赴挪德卡莱。每个地方都有其自成方圆的规则，这本是常理。只是，从各方线报观之，那片土地的运行之道，更显特别几分。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e商海浮沉，我深知一个道理：金钱的流向，总是与权柄的罗盘交相缠绕。伏尼契商会在挪德卡莱的棋盘上，算得上一枚分量不轻的棋子。若途中偶遇一时之困，或可考虑与之做一番交易。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e自然，以上权作一盏薄茶时的闲叙建议。真正的抉摘，全在你心中那杆秤上。洞察先机，权衡利弊，向来是你的长处。我不需多言。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e遥祝此行顺遂，风帆如意。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"831\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/26f915d93ca74fc9a520f3a1bdc5427f_3255367856372646779.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「繁荣」的指引\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/831/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/831/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「繁荣」的指引\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"184\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/09/25/24077343/29b367eba87054fb6121b28ce031f301_4745604186069189650.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"乾坤摩拉肉\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/184/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e乾坤摩拉肉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/71f7e1cc3e3c0a8da5b0c32167739c92_8221268305866108563.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/50494840/71f7e1cc3e3c0a8da5b0c32167739c92_8221268305866108563.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/67872661\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e凝光生日快乐｜赏荷？没想到你还有这番闲情雅致。\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"],\"key\":\"\"}]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8182","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色洞天对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"child_ids\":{\"23njc1xxgemT1757425501147\":[\"r1q7bmuhvpfT1757425516342\"],\"25xbveh7tcsT1757425330315\":[],\"335g6xw3ixaT1757425561667\":[],\"6iexm5jeychT1757425295899\":[],\"735cizxp3ihT1757425455104\":[\"kkp02xi91pT1757425456248\",\"tlqif0f2kepT1757425456945\"],\"8nfvx2ns0caT1757425501904\":[\"r1q7bmuhvpfT1757425516342\"],\"92ge8a0jgiT1757424891457\":[\"fmnlkdu5ghT1757425294865\",\"9mg6kbjdi9vT1757425295224\",\"cvgnaw1p1whT1757425295549\",\"6iexm5jeychT1757425295899\",\"xdnlt65ahfgT1757425297416\"],\"9mg6kbjdi9vT1757425295224\":[\"735cizxp3ihT1757425455104\"],\"ae09qr2nobeT1757425329626\":[],\"cvgnaw1p1whT1757425295549\":[\"23njc1xxgemT1757425501147\",\"8nfvx2ns0caT1757425501904\"],\"fmnlkdu5ghT1757425294865\":[\"ae09qr2nobeT1757425329626\",\"25xbveh7tcsT1757425330315\"],\"ik1cjolgrsrT1757425542052\":[\"335g6xw3ixaT1757425561667\"],\"kkp02xi91pT1757425456248\":[],\"r1q7bmuhvpfT1757425516342\":[\"ui2sibv1q5T1757425535943\",\"ik1cjolgrsrT1757425542052\"],\"tlqif0f2kepT1757425456945\":[],\"ui2sibv1q5T1757425535943\":[],\"xdnlt65ahfgT1757425297416\":[]},\"contents\":{\"23njc1xxgemT1757425501147\":{\"option\":\"【是去整理资料吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"25xbveh7tcsT1757425330315\":{\"option\":\"【过奖了。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e我并不是在恭维你。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"335g6xw3ixaT1757425561667\":{\"option\":\"【我一定尽我所能。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，我相信你。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哦，对了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e在做出决策之后，你就替我将那墙上的资料碾碎吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这摇撼商界的「碎雪」，下次就由你来洒落。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"6iexm5jeychT1757425295899\":{\"option\":\"【早啊，凝光。】——【白天】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e早，旅行者。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅途中如遇为难之处，与我但说无妨。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"735cizxp3ihT1757425455104\":{\"option\":\"【不…只是简单的聊天而已。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e有意思…那些富商巨贾，都为请我吃一顿饭而挤破头皮。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e而你，却只是想和我「简单」聊几句？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8nfvx2ns0caT1757425501904\":{\"option\":\"【是想让我学习决策的思路吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"92ge8a0jgiT1757424891457\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者，你好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e可有要事要与我商量？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"9mg6kbjdi9vT1757425295224\":{\"option\":\"【想一起聊聊天吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e聊天？你的意思是，有什么商业问题想同我探讨吗？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ae09qr2nobeT1757425329626\":{\"option\":\"【这里…恐怕比不上群玉阁吧。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哦，你不要误会。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e地方好坏不应简单以大小奢简来衡量。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我感受到的，是你在此投入的心意，这让我想起自己当初建造群玉阁时的样子。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e换句话说，这里是属于你的「群玉阁」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"cvgnaw1p1whT1757425295549\":{\"option\":\"【有什么想做的吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯…有一件事我计划很久了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e下次有大事要决策的时候，我想请你一同前往。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"fmnlkdu5ghT1757425294865\":{\"option\":\"【在这里还习惯吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，这里环境舒适，能让人静下心来思考问题。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e就像在群玉阁上的那些日子…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ik1cjolgrsrT1757425542052\":{\"option\":\"【交给我吧。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，我喜欢你的魄力。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e商界如战场，决策时需要的就是这样的自信与果断。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你在旅途中所积累的见识，也会使决策更加富有远见。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"kkp02xi91pT1757425456248\":{\"option\":\"【我没有那么多钱…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哈，说笑了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e知道吗？他们送我的东西极尽奢华…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e但那只不过是期待从我的只言片语中嗅到商界的动向罢了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e正因如此，与你在此轻松闲聊的时光，对我来说才显得弥足珍贵。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这是再多摩拉都换不到的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e所以，再这样陪我一会儿吧，聊聊那些在你看来「简单」的话题。什么都好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"r1q7bmuhvpfT1757425516342\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e不，我是想…说不定可以让你参与到「决策」中来。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"tlqif0f2kepT1757425456945\":{\"option\":\"【我们聊凝光喜欢的话题就好。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e…你果然和别人不太一样。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ui2sibv1q5T1757425535943\":{\"option\":\"【我能处理好吗…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e放心吧，我是不会看错的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你在旅途中所积累的学识与魄力，将会使决策更加富有远见。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，我相信你。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哦，对了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e在做出决策之后，你就替我将那墙上的资料碾碎吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这摇撼商界的「碎雪」，下次就由你来洒落。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"xdnlt65ahfgT1757425297416\":{\"option\":\"【晚安，凝光。】——【夜晚】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嗯，晚安，旅行者。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e无须顾虑太多。好好休息吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"92ge8a0jgiT1757424891457\"}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8227","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/09/24077343/90a97df3e6568fe069b9388b599c9e97_6074984136531877057.jpg\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8228","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色赠礼","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"同伴赠礼\",\"header\":[\"好感套装\",\"对应奖励\",\"好感套装对话\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2201\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/06/26/159922380/db7afc09f11a4c852260df3def2d7786_7359349219852381714.png\\\" data-entry-na